<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h3>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><span style="color: #0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Case%20keyword" title="Case keyword (page does not exist)">case</a></span> EVENT_TYPE_CHARGEN_END:<br />{<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oModule = <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetEventCreator" title="GetEventCreator">GetEventCreator</a>(ev); <span style="color: #007F00; font-style: italic;">// </span><br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nMode = <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetEventInteger" title="GetEventInteger">GetEventInteger</a>(ev, <span style="color: #7F007F;">0</span>); <span style="color: #007F00; font-style: italic;">// can be CHARGEN_MODE_CREATE (for character creation) or CHARGEN_MODE_LEVELUP (for leveling up)</span><br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nExitPoint = <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetEventInteger" title="GetEventInteger">GetEventInteger</a>(ev, <span style="color: #7F007F;">1</span>); <span style="color: #007F00; font-style: italic;">// </span><br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oChar = <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetEventObject" title="GetEventObject">GetEventObject</a>(ev, <span style="color: #7F007F;">0</span>); <span style="color: #007F00; font-style: italic;">// the creature undergoing levelup</span><br /><br />    <span style="color:#007F00; font-style:italic;">// insert event-handling code here</span><br /><br />    <span style="color:#0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Break%20keyword" title="Break keyword (page does not exist)">break</a></span>;<br />}</div>
